dates/CStarTracialWeightCore.lean:242:theorem nonempty_tracialWeightCore_source_of_target :\nAristotleCandidates/CStarTracialWeightCore.lean:243:    Nonempty (TracialWeightCore D.target) → Nonempty (TracialWeightCore D.source) :=\nAristotleCandidates/CStarTracialWeightCore.lean:247:theorem nonempty_tracialWeightCore_source_iff_target :\nAristotleCandidates/CStarTracialWeightCore.lean:248:    Nonempty (TracialWeightCore D.source) ↔ Nonempty (TracialWeightCore D.target) :=\nAristotleCandidates/CStarTracialWeightCore.lean:258:  ⟨isometry_equivalence D, isometry_equivalence_symm D,\nFormalization/ProperlyInfiniteTraceObstruction.lean:34:infinite isometry hypotheses. -/\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
